{"product_id":"buture-cordless-vacuum-cleaner-vc80","title":"Buture VC80 Cordless Vacuum Cleaner | 450W 40KPA","description":"\u003cp\u003eSearching for an intelligent cordless vacuum? Look no further than the BuTure VC80. This top-of-the-line cordless vacuum boasts a powerful 450W motor and 40kPa suction, ensuring deep cleaning across all surfaces. With its automatic suction adjustment, advanced six-layer filtration system, and smart touch screen, VC80 cordless vacuum brings a new level of convenience and efficiency to your cleaning routine. Its self-standing design and comprehensive accessory kit add to the ease and versatility. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eWhat Makes it Your Smart Decision:\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eAuto-adjust Suction Power\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe BuTure VC80 cordless vacuum features intelligent technology that automatically adjusts suction power based on the type of surface. When you move from a carpeted living room to a hardwood kitchen, this cordless vacuum will detect the change of floor type and adjust the suction power accordingly. This smart function ensures optimal cleaning performance without the need for manual adjustments, making your cleaning routine seamless and efficient, while optimizing battery usage.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003eBenefits:\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSeamless Cleaning Routine:\u003c\/strong\u003e Automatically adjusts to the optimal suction power, eliminating the need for manual adjustments and making cleaning more convenient.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOptimized Battery Usage: \u003c\/strong\u003eBy switching to the appropriate mode, the vacuum conserves energy, ensuring longer battery life and more efficient cleaning sessions.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEnhanced Cleaning Performance:\u003c\/strong\u003e Adapts to different surfaces to provide the best cleaning results, ensuring every part of your home is spotless.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003eThree Modes:\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003col class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal;\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMAX Mode:\u003c\/strong\u003e 40kPa suction power for deep cleaning. Ideal for heavily soiled carpets and rugs, this mode activates when the vacuum detects thick carpet fibers, providing a powerful clean for stubborn dirt and pet hair.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMID Mode:\u003c\/strong\u003e 28kPa suction power for everyday cleaning tasks. Perfect for regular maintenance on a variety of surfaces, the vacuum adjusts to this mode for moderate dirt and debris, balancing power and efficiency.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eECO Mode: \u003c\/strong\u003e15kPa suction power for extended battery life. Suitable for light cleaning tasks, this mode activates on hard floors, conserving energy and extending cleaning time, making it ideal for large areas or prolonged use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ol\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eSelf-Standing Feature\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe BuTure VC80 cordless vacuum is designed with a self-standing feature, offering unparalleled convenience and ease of use. This allows you to pause your cleaning at any time without needing to lean the vacuum against a wall or find a surface to prop it up. Simply let go, and the vacuum stands upright on its own.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003eBenefits:\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHands-Free Convenience: Whether you need to answer the door, take a phone call, or move furniture, the self-standing feature ensures your vacuum is always ready to go when you return.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEasy Storage: The Buture VC80 cordless vacuum offers versatile storage options, allowing you to either stand it on the floor or mount it on the wall.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEnhanced Stability: Reduces the risk of the vacuum tipping over, protecting both the appliance and your home from potential damage.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQuick Accessibility: Perfect for quick clean-ups and spot cleaning, as you can easily grab and use the vacuum without hassle.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eSmart Touch Screen Design\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe BuTure VC80 cordless vacuum features a sleek and intuitive smart touch screen, adding modern technology to your cleaning routine. This user-friendly interface allows you to easily switch between Eco, Mid, and Max modes with a simple touch, ensuring the right power level for any task. Real-time monitoring lets you keep an eye on battery life, dust cup fullness, and filter maintenance, preventing interruptions and maintaining optimal performance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAdditionally, the touch screen provides timely maintenance alerts, ensuring your vacuums work at peak efficiency. This advanced design enhances your user experience, making cleaning more effortless and enjoyable. The clear, responsive display transforms vacuuming into a seamless and modern experience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eSix-Layer Filtration System\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe BuTure VC80 cordless vacuum is equipped with an advanced six-layer filtration system, ensuring that your home remains clean and free from allergens.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStainless Steel Primary Filter: Captures large particles such as hair and debris.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStainless Steel Secondary Filter: Provides an additional layer of filtration for medium-sized particles.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHEPA Filter: Traps fine dust and allergens, ensuring that only clean air is expelled.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSponge Filter: Adds an extra layer to capture smaller dust particles.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDust Cup: Efficiently collects and holds dust and debris.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMotor Air Cooling Filter: Protects the motor by filtering the air, ensuring long-lasting performance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eAdvanced Design of VC80 Cordless Vacuum\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe BuTure VC80 cordless vacuum stands out not only for its powerful performance and intelligent features but also for its advanced design elements that elevate your cleaning experience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eEasy Dust Cup Emptying\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe vacuum features a one-click emptying mechanism, allowing you to quickly and effortlessly dispose of collected dust and debris without making a mess. This hassle-free process ensures that you can maintain the vacuum's performance with minimal effort.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eFilter Maintenance Alerts\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe smart touchscreen provides notifications for timely filter cleaning and replacement. These alerts ensure that your vacuum operates at peak efficiency, prolonging its lifespan and maintaining optimal suction power.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eAnti-Tangle Roller Brush with LED Floor Lights\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe BuTure VC80 cordless vacuum features anti-tangle roller brush heads, designed to prevent hair and debris from clogging, ensuring smooth operation. Its specialized bristles effectively clean edges and corners, leaving no dirt behind. If necessary, the vacuum comes with a small cutting tool included in the accessory kit to help you easily remove any tangled hair, enhancing the anti-tangle feature and keeping your vacuum performing at its best. Additionally, the brush is equipped with LED floor lights that illuminate dark areas, ensuring you don’t miss any hidden dirt and debris.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eComprehensive Accessory Kit\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIncluded Attachments:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCrevice tool, dusting brush, electric floor brush, mini cleaning brush.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHEPA filters (2), sponge filters (2), telescopic tube, wall mount, and charger.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEnhanced Cleaning Efficiency: Attachments designed for specific cleaning tasks and surfaces.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eButure VC80 Specification\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cstyle\u003e\n    .vc80-table {\n        width: 100%;\n        border-collapse: collapse;\n        margin-top: 10px;\n        table-layout: fixed;\n    }\n    .vc80-table th, .vc80-table td {\n        border: 1px solid #ddd;\n        padding: 8px;\n        text-align: left;\n        word-wrap: break-word;\n    }\n    .vc80-table th {\n        background-color: #EE6819;\n        color: white;\n        font-weight: bold;\n    }\n    .vc80-table tr:nth-child(even) {\n        background-color: #f9f9f9;\n    }\n\u003c\/style\u003e\n\u003ctable class=\"vc80-table\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eFeature\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eSpecification\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eSuction Power\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e450W\/40kPa\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eAutomatic Adjustment\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eYes\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eRuntime\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e50-60mins\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eItem Weight\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e5.95 lbs\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eDust Bin Capacity\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\"\u003e1.5 Liters\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eCharging Time\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e4-5 hours\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eTouch Screen\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eCrevice Tool\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eTwo-in-one Brush\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eHair Cleaning Tool\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eSelf-Standing\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eBattery Pack\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003ex1\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eHEPA\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003ex2\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eSponge Filter\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003ex2\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003c\/tbody\u003e\n\u003c\/table\u003e","brand":"Buture Official","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45492889256191,"sku":"VC80","price":159.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.